<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at lower July Brent +9 cents.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at lower July Brent +9 cents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dated Brent traded at a premium of nine cents to July forward paper on Tuesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The June 11-13 cargo, nominated from the paper chains on Tuesday, was kept by Wall Street trader Phibro and then sold to another trading house.</p>
<p>The deal follows a Dated Brent trade on Friday at July Brent +17 cents.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
